<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARY JUNE PPI UP 0.8 PCT M/M, UP 19.4 PCT YR/YR.</title>
<headline>HUNGARY JUNE PPI UP 0.8 PCT M/M, UP 19.4 PCT YR/YR.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's June producer price index (PPI) rose 0.8 percent and was up 19.4 percent year-on-year, the central statistical office (KSH) said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The figures are final and unchanged from the preliminary figures, released on August 4.</p>
<p>In May, domestic sales prices rose 0.6 percent month-on-month and 18.9 percent year-on-year. Meanwhile, export prices firmed 1.4 percent month-on-month and 20.2 percent year-on-year.</p>
<p>HUNGARY PRODUCER PRICE INDEX</p>
<p>					 June 1997  May 1997  June 1996</p>
<p>    Month-on-month change (pct)   +0.8     +0.7	+0.7</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change (pct)    +19.4    +19.1     +21.5</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +361 327 4040</p>
